Constraints
ID3 does not support numeric attributes directly.
Iris and Glass datasets require discretization before applying ID3.
J48 can directly handle numeric attributes.
k-NN benefits from normalization of numeric attributes.
ROC curves should be generated for each classifier.
Cross-validation should be used for reliable evaluation.
Glass dataset contains numeric features and relatively few instances, making classifier selection important.
